Throwable
Throwable





  &reftitle.intro;

   The base interface of everything that can be thrown, implemented by
   Exception and Error; user classes implement it only by extending one of
   those.


   This page is only a summary; the full documentation is in the PHP manual:
   Throwable.





  &reftitle.interfacesynopsis;



    Throwable



